  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Butterfly room is a deluxe king room and is one of two rooms that that make up Kambing house; an almost 100 year old teak ‘Limasan' family house from central Java that has been divided into 2 guest rooms. Butterfly rooms shares an entrance with Dragonfly room and has private use of half of the oversized verandah. Kambing house is located closest to the rice terraces and river and is thus furthest from the restaurant and swimming pool.",
   "section_id": "comp-mfwniwpf",
   "y": 1732,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#000000"
  },
