   "color": "#000000"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "It is the coolest of the rooms, the last room that needs the aircon switched on, and is also the room with the least natural light. Perfect for guests who like to sleep in. The bathroom has the most spectacular view of all the bathrooms at Bali Lush; a picture window looks directly out across the rice terraces making for a very special shower experience.",
