   "color": "#000000"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The room is most suitable for solo travellers, couples, or a family of 3 and comes standard as Super King four poster canopy bed 200 x 200 cm with mosquito net and 1 single bed 90 cm x 180 cm. Families or groups of friends wishing to have seperate bedrooms adjoining each other should book both Dragonfly and Butterfly rooms together.",
