  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "> View All Testimonials",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2512,
   "font": "assistant-v2",
   "size": "20.49px",
   "weight": "500",
   "color": "#AE095B"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "My husband and I came here for our honeymoon and absolutely loved it! We were blown away with how beautiful the area was, and loved the tours around the area. Very relaxing place and highly recommend!",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2600,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The Bali in your dream. Serene and peaceful. Beautifully decorated Java house and plantation. I can't get tired of the view ever.  Attentive staff and warm hosts. Your hospitality and life wisdom have really inspired me. I cant love this place more. Food was simple but delicious. It changed my view towards Bali. Thank you so much!!",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2600,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Danielle R",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2693,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "CYH",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2744,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "It only took one night for us to fall in love with Bali Lush! Set against a breathtaking backdrop of lush, tiered rice fields, this Javanese-inspired boutique retreat felt welcoming from the moment we arrived. The food is some of the best we had on our trip, thanks to the care and menu planning by host/co-owner Camron Henry. She handpicks tried-and-true recipes that showcase Bali's amazing offerings, plus, her kitchen bakes homemade bread that's to die for. What's more, I celebrated by birthday there and Camron's staff surprised me with the most delectable chocolate cake! Ok - one more thing: I also had the best in-room massage there. Seriously. Camron, her husband David, their sweet dogs and wonderful staff make Bali Lush a place that we can't wait to return to next time!",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2852,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The place to stay if to want to have a good rest in the nature. Good cooking (important for French people) and good advise to visit interesting areas. All the team is very friendly.No négative remark can be said about this place. We will have to come back",
   "section_id": "comp-mf6wyo49",
   "y": 2852,
   "font": "madefor-text",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "color": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
